    # you "Which five chores?"
    you "どの五つの用事ですか？"

# game/case09.rpy:64
translate japanese press_kaguya_1_3399144f:

    # kaguya "Little things. A dragon's jewel, a fire-rat robe. The usual."
    kaguya "ちょっとしたことよ。龍の頸の玉、火鼠の皮衣。いつものもの。"

# game/case09.rpy:66
translate japanese press_kaguya_1_cf1232a4:

    # eiki "The usual for whom?"
    eiki "誰にとっての「いつもの」ですか？"

# game/case09.rpy:70
translate japanese press_kaguya_2_315cafce:

    # you "Surprised? Why?"
    you "驚いた？なぜですか？"

# game/case09.rpy:72
translate japanese press_kaguya_2_df01c73a:

    # kaguya "Nobody has finished my list in a thousand years. It's been a while."
    kaguya "千年間、誰も私のリストを終えられなかったの。久しぶりだわ。"

# game/case09.rpy:76
translate japanese press_kaguya_3_6d0818cc:

    # you "Why not? She finished all five."
    you "なぜですか？彼女は五つすべて終えました。"

# game/case09.rpy:77
translate japanese press_kaguya_3_76b6752c:

    # kaguya "Ah, but finishing was never really the point. Add this to my testimony."
    kaguya "あら、終えることが目的だったわけじゃないの。これを証言に加えて。"

# game/case09.rpy:81
translate japanese press_kaguya_4_65bc0e33:

    # you "The moon wasn't on the list. When did you add it?"
    you "月はリストにありませんでした。いつ加えたのですか？"

# game/case09.rpy:83
translate japanese press_kaguya_4_156e1420:

    # kaguya "This morning. After she finished the other five. Obviously."
    kaguya "今朝よ。あの子が他の五つを終えた後。当然でしょう。"

# game/case09.rpy:85
translate japanese press_kaguya_4_0fe2b220:

    # eiki "So the finish line moved the moment she reached it."
    eiki "つまり、彼女がたどり着いた瞬間にゴールが動いたのですね。"

# game/case09.rpy:96
translate japanese case9_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。"

# game/case09.rpy:98
translate japanese case9_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告人は？"

# game/case09.rpy:99
translate japanese case9_5ce059df:

    # komachi "She sent word, boss. She'll arrive when she feels like it."
    komachi "伝言がありましたよ、四季様。気が向いたら来るそうです。"

# game/case09.rpy:100
translate japanese case9_5c746e50:

    # eiki "Bring her in. Now."
    eiki "連れてきなさい。今すぐ。"

# game/case09.rpy:101
translate japanese case9_7d10e9c3:

    # komachi "...She feels like it now."
    komachi "……今、気が向いたそうです。"

# game/case09.rpy:104
translate japanese case9_7887afd8:

    # kaguya "Kaguya Houraisan, princess of Eientei. How charming. A courtroom."
    kaguya "永遠亭の姫、蓬莱山輝夜よ。素敵ね。法廷だなんて。"

# game/case09.rpy:107
translate japanese case9_46a91cf7:

    # eiki "The charge: refusing your assistant, Reisen, the week off you promised her."
    eiki "罪状：助手の鈴仙に約束した一週間の休みを与えないこと。"

# game/case09.rpy:110
translate japanese case9_5d651121:

    # kaguya "Promised? I set her a few little tasks. She simply hasn't finished them."
    kaguya "約束？ちょっとした課題を出しただけよ。あの子がまだ終えていないだけ。"

# game/case09.rpy:114
translate japanese case9_159a5823:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. A fair test keeps its rules from start to finish."
    eiki "見習い判事。公正な試験は、始めから終わりまで規則が変わりません。"

# game/case09.rpy:115
translate japanese case9_a1bb9f82:

    # eiki "When the finish line moves every time someone reaches it, the race was never fair."
    eiki "誰かがたどり着くたびにゴールが動くなら、その競走は最初から公正ではありません。"

# game/case09.rpy:131
translate japanese case9_450b8965:

    # kaguya_t "I told Reisen she could take a week off if she finished five chores."
    kaguya_t "鈴仙には、五つの用事を終えたら一週間休んでいいと言ったわ。"

# game/case09.rpy:132
translate japanese case9_c2ac9ddc:

    # kaguya_t "Yesterday she brought me all five. I admit I was surprised."
    kaguya_t "昨日、あの子は五つ全部持ってきたの。正直、驚いたわ。"

# game/case09.rpy:133
translate japanese case9_0649c7b5:

    # kaguya_t "But she still hasn't earned her week off."
    kaguya_t "でも、まだ一週間の休みには値しないの。"

# game/case09.rpy:137
translate japanese case9_cc48e40d:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. She has had a thousand years of practice."
    eiki "証人をどうぞ、見習い判事。彼女には千年の経験があります。"

# game/case09.rpy:151
translate japanese case9_cross_58e06995:

    # eiki "Again. The princess has time. So, apparently, do we."
    eiki "もう一度。姫には時間があります。どうやら私たちにも。"

# game/case09.rpy:162
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_33e34ebd:

    # you "This list has your signature. Five chores, then a week off. All five are ticked."
    you "このリストにはあなたの署名があります。五つの用事の後に一週間の休み。五つすべてに印がついています。"

# game/case09.rpy:163
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_ecfaa82a:

    # you "Reisen reached the line you drew. You moved it the moment she got there."
    you "鈴仙はあなたが引いた線にたどり着きました。あなたはその瞬間に線を動かしたのです。"

# game/case09.rpy:166
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_b42792a1:

    # kaguya "...My signature. In ink. How very unlike me."
    kaguya "……私の署名。墨で。私らしくもない。"

# game/case09.rpy:170
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_0b2e0098:

    # eiki "Moving the goalposts. Change the test as soon as it is passed, and no answer is ever enough."
    eiki "ゴールポストの移動。合格した途端に試験を変えれば、どんな答えも足りなくなります。"

# game/case09.rpy:171
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_d64a2b08:

    # eiki "A promise judged by new rules is not a promise. It is a trap."
    eiki "新しい規則で裁かれる約束は、約束ではありません。罠です。"

# game/case09.rpy:178
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_dc9e9248:

    # eiki "Defendant Kaguya Houraisan. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告人、蓬莱山輝夜。当法廷はあなたを……"

# game/case09.rpy:189
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_7af39709:

    # eiki "Sentence: Reisen takes her week off, starting today. You will do her chores."
    eiki "判決：鈴仙は今日から一週間休みます。その間、あなたが彼女の用事をこなすこと。"

# game/case09.rpy:192
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_abeac172:

    # kaguya "Me? Chores? ...Do I have to fetch my own tea?"
    kaguya "私が？用事を？……お茶も自分で淹れなきゃいけないの？"

# game/case09.rpy:195
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_5455e8c7:

    # eiki "Every cup. Bailiff."
    eiki "一杯残らず。廷吏。"

# game/case09.rpy:196
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "はいよ、四季様。"

# game/case09.rpy:211
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_7fda5bef:

    # mokou "KAGUYAAA!"
    mokou "かぐやぁぁぁ！"

# game/case09.rpy:212
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_b9f4317c:

    # kaguya "Oh no. Not now. Not in court."
    kaguya "あら嫌だ。今はやめて。法廷よ。"

# game/case09.rpy:213
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_f5cfe6d1:

    # mokou "Fujiwara no Mokou. Heard you finally lost something. Thought I'd help you lose more."
    mokou "藤原妹紅だ。ついに負けたって聞いてな。もっと負けさせてやろうと思って。"

# game/case09.rpy:214
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_e5bdca6e:

    # eiki "This is a courtroom. The defendant is in this court's custody."
    eiki "ここは法廷です。被告人は当法廷の管理下にあります。"

# game/case09.rpy:215
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_31614309:

    # mokou "Great. I'll take custody."
    mokou "そりゃいい。じゃあ私が引き取る。"

# game/case09.rpy:227
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_53f15046:

    # kaguya "Ow! Ow! My face is priceless!"
    kaguya "痛っ、痛っ！私の顔はお金で買えないのよ！"

# game/case09.rpy:228
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_a2e3c33a:

    # mokou "So's this. Free of charge."
    mokou "こっちもだ。お代はいらないぜ。"

# game/case09.rpy:239
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_67271a1c:

    # kaguya "Eirin! Somebody! Bailiff!"
    kaguya "永琳！誰か！廷吏！"

# game/case09.rpy:242
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_88995a40:

    # komachi "...Want me to chase them, boss?"
    komachi "……追いかけましょうか、四季様？"

# game/case09.rpy:243
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_0f642d8c:

    # eiki "No. They have been doing this for a thousand years. They will be back by dinner."
    eiki "いいえ。あの二人は千年もこれを続けています。夕食までには戻るでしょう。"

# game/case09.rpy:244
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_69add51b:

    # eiki "Reisen's week off begins regardless. Court is adjourned."
    eiki "鈴仙の休暇はそれでも始まります。閉廷します。"

# game/case09.rpy:245
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_cebf22fd:

    # komachi "That's the whole docket, boss."
    komachi "これで全部の事件です、四季様。"

# game/case09.rpy:246
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_71bf8c82:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Your work was... more than acceptable."
    eiki "見習い判事。あなたの働きは……及第点以上でした。"

# game/case09.rpy:247
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_42d7cba4:

    # komachi "She's never said that before. Not once."
    komachi "四季様がそんなこと言うの、初めてですよ。一度も聞いたことない。"

# game/case09.rpy:248
translate japanese case9_breakthrough_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case09.rpy:249
